  data: {
    LLM: "Be conservative. Given the deck only goes up to 12, 'busting' is very easy if you have a total of 15 or higher. Stand on 16.\n\nThe 12 Shift: Use the 12 card's flexibility. If you have a total of 11, and draw a 12, value it at 9 to hit 20. If you have a total of 9 and draw a 12, value it at 12 to hit 21 exactly.\n\nBanker Tracking: In the 24-card deck (two of each number), pay attention to which 11s and 12s have already appeared. If three 12s have been played, you know the next high draw is more likely to be an 8 or 10.",
    Player: "Be conservative. Given the deck only goes up to 12, 'busting' is very easy if you have a total of 15 or higher. Stand on 16.\n\nThe 12 Shift: Use the 12 card's flexibility. If you have a total of 11, and draw a 12, value it at 9 to hit 20. If you have a total of 9 and draw a 12, value it at 12 to hit 21 exactly.\n\nBanker Tracking: In the 24-card deck (two of each number), pay attention to which 11s and 12s have already appeared. If three 12s have been played, you know the next high draw is more likely to be an 8 or 10.",
